      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T18:31:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "GM_blur_ignore_xform_rrect isn\u0027t nine-patchable due to the large sigma, and GM_simpleblurroundrect was over 1ms likely due to the need to make the nine-patch textures.\n \nblurrectsninepatch was 40.7-42.4us, mainly averaging around 41.5. I would\u0027ve guessed it would be a bit higher due to needing to make the ninepatch texture, but since the rrect is small with a 2.3 corner radii, and running with ~177 loops, that probably doesn\u0027t add much overhead.",
      "parentUuid": "7e8a1a42_3b20c9f2",
